(DEMO DOCUMENT - Costing Policy \(Rev 3, April 2026\)) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(1. Purpose) Tj T*
(This policy sets how manufacturing cost is planned, recorded and reviewed for every) Tj T*
(customer order \(bolts, nuts, flange bolts and steel assemblies\).) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(2. Standard cost of an order) Tj T*
(Standard cost = material + direct labour + machine hours + overheads + packaging.) Tj T*
(Overheads are applied at 12% of material, labour and machine cost.) Tj T*
(Packaging is charged at the rate in the company rules \(per order\).) Tj T*
(A scrap allowance of 2% of material weight is included in every material estimate.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(3. Night shifts) Tj T*
(A night shift may be added to a machine only to protect a committed ship date.) Tj T*
(Night shift labour carries a premium of 25% over the day rate for the crew,) Tj T*
(plus the machine's night cost per hour. Every night shift added to a plan needs) Tj T*
(the owner's approval before it is scheduled, and is reviewed in the monthly cost meeting.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
