(DEMO DOCUMENT - Costing Policy \(Rev 3, April 2026\) - page 2) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(4. Material price variance) Tj T*
(Purchase prices are compared with the standard rate of each material every month.) Tj T*
(A material price variance above 5% for any material \(for example steel wire rod or) Tj T*
(MS bright bar\) must be explained by Purchasing with supplier quotes, and the standard) Tj T*
(rate is updated if the change is expected to last more than one quarter.) Tj T*
(Express freight is allowed only when a shortage would make an order late; its cost is) Tj T*
(booked to the order that needed it.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(5. Monthly cost review) Tj T*
(Each month Accounts compares planned and actual cost per order: material, labour,) Tj T*
(machine hours, scrap and rework. Any order whose margin falls below the company's) Tj T*
(minimum margin \(18%\) is reviewed with Planning and Sales before similar orders are quoted.) Tj T*
ET
